# 🎓 AI Study Assistant

An AI-powered Study Assistant built using **Python**, **Streamlit**, **Groq LLM**, and **PyPDF** that helps students learn more effectively by generating summaries, quizzes, flashcards, notes, and topic explanations from uploaded PDF study materials.

---

## 🚀 Features

✅ Upload PDF study materials

✅ Generate concise summaries

✅ Create multiple-choice quizzes

✅ Generate flashcards for quick revision

✅ Produce structured study notes

✅ Explain complex topics in simple language

✅ Interactive Streamlit web interface

✅ Powered by Groq Large Language Models (LLMs)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- Python 3.11
- Streamlit
- Groq API
- PyPDF
- Python Dotenv
